  "profile": "Computer Science graduate specializing in real-time computer graphics, GPU programming and machine learning. Experienced in C++, Vulkan and Python through research at KIT and Fraunhofer IOSB. Interested in neural rendering, differentiable graphics and computer vision.",
  "projects": [
    {
      "end": "2026",
